{"name":"Salute","hex":"#2f323d","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"salute","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["An utterance or gesture expressing greeting or honor towards someone,  a formal, non-verbal gesture made with the arms or hands in any of various specific positions. .mw-parser-output .defdate{font-size:smaller}","A kiss, offered in salutation."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To make a gesture in honor of (someone or something).","To act in thanks, honor, or tribute; to thank or extend gratitude; to praise."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/salute"}],"entries":[{"title":"Salute","blocks":[{"text":"A salute is usually a formal hand gesture or other action used to display respect in military situations. Salutes are primarily associated with the military and law enforcement, but many civilian organizations, such as Girl Guides, Boy Scouts and the Salvation Army use formal salutes. Ordinary civilians also salute informally to greet or acknowledge the presence of another person, such as a tip of the hat or a hand wave to a friend or neighbor."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/89/Victory_Day_Parade_2005-14.jpg/330px-Victory_Day_Parade_2005-14.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Salute"},{"title":"Salute (Little Mix album)","blocks":[{"text":"Salute is the second studio album by British girl group Little Mix, released on 8 November 2013 through Syco Music and Columbia Records. The album was mostly co-written by Little Mix, who stated that they were more involved in the development of this album compared to their debut album DNA. The album was preceded by the lead single \"Move\", and included two further singles, \"Little Me\", and \"Salute\"."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/f/fc/Little_Mix_Salute_%28Official_Album_Cover%29.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Salute_(Little_Mix_album)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3c/Firli_Bahuri_Kapolda.png/500px-Firli_Bahuri_Kapolda.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3c/Firli_Bahuri_Kapolda.png/500px-Firli_Bahuri_Kapolda.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"An Indonesian National Police general giving a salute","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AFirli_Bahuri_Kapolda.png"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/31/Defense.gov_News_Photo_060216-F-4462M-017.jpg/500px-Defense.gov_News_Photo_060216-F-4462M-017.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/31/Defense.gov_News_Photo_060216-F-4462M-017.jpg/1280px-Defense.gov_News_Photo_060216-F-4462M-017.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/31/Defense.gov_News_Photo_060216-F-4462M-017.jpg/500px-Defense.gov_News_Photo_060216-F-4462M-017.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Pakistan army soldiers saluting British-style, palms facing outward","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ADefense.gov_News_Photo_060216-F-4462M-017.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/76/Soldiers_say_goodbye_to_Macedonian_friends_DVIDS97161.jpg/500px-Soldiers_say_goodbye_to_Macedonian_friends_DVIDS97161.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/76/Soldiers_say_goodbye_to_Macedonian_friends_DVIDS97161.jpg/1280px-Soldiers_say_goodbye_to_Macedonian_friends_DVIDS97161.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnai